-- title:
--   Étale fundamental group of affine space over a finite field: Kummer theory and prime-to-p characters (EtPi1 library, file 01)
-- statement:
--   Definitions and lemmas for the étale fundamental group $\pi_1 = \mathrm{Gal}(K_U/K)$ of $\mathrm{Spec}\,A$, where $K_U \subset \overline{K}$ is the maximal extension of $K = \mathrm{Frac}\,A$ unramified over $A$, and for its geometric subgroup $\pi_1^{\mathrm{geo}}$ (automorphisms fixing all constants) when $A = \mathbb{F}[x_1, \dots, x_n]$ with $\mathbb{F}$ finite of characteristic $p$. Built on the flat curve library (`Def_RPLib_F2_004`). Contents, in dependency order:
--
--   * Kummer theory for a subgroup $\Gamma \le \mathrm{Gal}(E/K)$ fixing a primitive $N$-th root of unity: the Kummer homomorphism and the isomorphism $\mathrm{rad}(\Gamma, N)/(\Gamma\text{-fixed units}) \cong H^1(\Gamma, \mathbb{Z}/N)$ (`kummerEquiv`);
--   * the fixed field of $\pi_1^{\mathrm{geo}}$ in $K_U$ is the union of the constant levels $K(\mathbb{F}_{p^k})$, and the resulting descriptions of radicals and fixed units;
--   * inertia and ramification indices in towers of Galois extensions of Dedekind domains, and trivial inertia at every prime of the integral closure in $K_U$;
--   * valuations at height-one primes of a UFD and $N$-th powers;
--   * the constant levels as fraction fields of $\mathbb{F}_{p^k}[x_1, \dots, x_n]$, and divisibility of orders by $N$ for $N$-th powers in unramified extensions;
--   * $H^1(\pi_1^{\mathrm{geo}}, \mathbb{Z}/N) = 0$ for $p \nmid N$, and the vanishing of every locally constant homomorphism $\pi_1^{\mathrm{geo}} \to \mathbb{Z}/N$.
-- source:
